{"id":"9f9bbceb69d7215d","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-cor-ch.md","title":"Continuum Hypothesis Corollary","display":"cor-ch — Continuum Hypothesis Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-ch","aliases":["58-cor-ch","58-cor-ch-properties","CH Properties"],"display":"cor-ch — Continuum Hypothesis Corollary","depends_on":["[[58-df-ch]]","[[58-df-continuum]]","[[58-df-aleph]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-ch"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-ch</span><span>58-cor-ch-properties</span><span>CH Properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-ch — Continuum Hypothesis Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"58-df-ch\">58-df-ch</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"58-df-continuum\">58-df-continuum</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"58-df-aleph\">58-df-aleph</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{c}\">\\(\\mathfrak{c}\\)</span> (连续统, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"58-df-continuum\">58-df-continuum</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CH}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CH}_S\\)</span> (连续统假设谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a8e91517c28976b8\" href=\"?note=a8e91517c28976b8\" title=\"58-df-ch\">58-df-ch</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1\\)</span> (aleph sequence, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"58-df-aleph\">58-df-aleph</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\to\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_S \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak c=\\aleph_1\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\to\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_S \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak c=\\aleph_1\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Since <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span>, the continuum hypothesis is equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=\\aleph_1\">\\(\\mathfrak c=\\aleph_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>This is independent of ZFC.</li>\n<li><code>58-cor-ch-properties</code> is merged here; it asserted the same equivalence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-ch","status":"resolved","id":"a8e91517c28976b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ch]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuum","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuum]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aleph","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-aleph]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuum","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{c}$ (连续统, see [[58-df-continuum]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ch","status":"resolved","id":"a8e91517c28976b8","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CH}_S$ (连续统假设谓词, see [[58-df-ch]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-aleph","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1$ (aleph sequence, see [[58-df-aleph]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{c}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CH}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ch} \\vdash \\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\to\\left(\\mathrm{CH}_S \\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak c=\\aleph_1\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c=\\aleph_1","display":false}],"bytes":887,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-37","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-cor-ch.md|58-cor-ch]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["a8e91517c28976b8","99c5552e170feee3","535817bf563314f5"]}